## Module plan
```

The feature is built inside a single module directory under `src/modules/` to logically encapsulate dependencies and maintain a single module registration count of **1** for health endpoint correctness.

### 1. File Layout Inside `src/` & `test/`
```
src/
├── modules/
│   ├── index.ts                     <-- (Modify: Registers KudosModule)
│   └── kudos/                       <-- (New Directory)
│       ├── kudos.module.ts          <-- (New Module)
│       ├── kudos.controller.ts      <-- (New Controller)
│       ├── kudos.service.ts          <-- (New Service)
│       └── prisma.service.ts        <-- (New Database Adapter Instance)
test/
